  "body": "The following places expect https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-script-base-url to be possibly null:\n - https://html.spec.whatwg.org/C#script-structs:concept-script-base-url\n - https://html.spec.whatwg.org/C#creating-scripts:concept-script-base-url-3\n - https://html.spec.whatwg.org/C#creating-scripts:concept-script-base-url-4\n - https://html.spec.whatwg.org/C#hostgetimportmetaproperties:concept-script-base-url\n\n... yet the actual member is _not_ null — it's only ever a URL struct, which I don't think can be \"null\". This PR simply marks the member as null _or_ a \"base\" URL.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9209/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 24, 2023, 7:15 PM UTC (b21d928)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9209/9bf6568...b21d928/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 24, 2023, 7:15 PM UTC (b21d928)\">diff</a> )",
